PHASE 7 — GOLD LAYER KPI CREATION
__________________________________

Now business metrics is created.


SQL Queries Written
___________________

Daily Revenue
_____________

SELECT
    store_id,
    sale_date,
    SUM(revenue) AS total_sales
FROM silver_sales
GROUP BY store_id, sale_date;

Top Selling Products
____________________

SELECT
    product_name,
    SUM(qty) AS units_sold
FROM silver_sales
GROUP BY product_name
ORDER BY units_sold DESC;

Customer Retention
__________________

SELECT
    customer_id,
    COUNT(DISTINCT order_id) AS repeat_orders
FROM silver_sales
GROUP BY customer_id;

